 "notes": "KSVZ QCD axion model. Constraint from isolated neutron star cooling (RX J1856.6-3754, RX J1308.6+2127, RX J0720.4-3125, RX J1605.3+3249, PSR J0659+1414). Main result: m_a < 16 meV at 95% confidence. Nucleon coupling g_an computed from QCD axion relation using KSVZ parameters (C_n=-0.02, m_n=0.939 GeV): g_an = C_n m_n / f_a = -0.02 * 0.939 / (5.7e6/m_a). Data points trace the excluded region from 0.01 meV to 16 meV, showing |g_an| at each mass point along the KSVZ line. Note: C_n is negative in KSVZ; absolute values plotted follow AxionLimitBench convention.",
